    {
      "category": "faculty",
      "field": "description",
      "value": "The Kemmy Business School (KBS) is a dynamic, innovative business school with a reputation, established over 30 years, for delivering a first-class business education that prepares graduates for successful, rewarding careers across a wide range of business disciplines and professions.",
