    {
      "category": "faculty",
      "field": "description",
      "value": "The Faculty of Science and Engineering is well recognised for the quality of its teaching and learning, academic programmes and research expertise. It has three world-class research institutes in Materials and Surface Sciences, Software Engineering and Mathematics, all underpinned by well-established industry links.",
